    {
      "conversationId": "mcginnis_seven_convo03",
      "lines": [
        {
          "order": 1,
          "character": "Seven",
          "audioFile": "gigawatt_match_start_gigawatt_forge_convo03_01",
          "audioUrl": "audio/gigawatt_match_start_gigawatt_forge_convo03_01.mp3",
          "text": "You were a prodigy, McGinnis.",
          "duration": 2.445
        },
        {
          "order": 2,
          "character": "Mcginnis",
          "audioFile": "forge_match_start_gigawatt_forge_convo03_02",
          "audioUrl": "audio/forge_match_start_gigawatt_forge_convo03_02.mp3",
          "text": "I still am.",
          "duration": 1.07
        },
        {
          "order": 3,
          "character": "Seven",
          "audioFile": "gigawatt_match_start_gigawatt_forge_convo03_03",
          "audioUrl": "audio/gigawatt_match_start_gigawatt_forge_convo03_03.mp3",
          "text": "I think it's safe to say you plateaued",
          "duration": 2.573
        },
        {
          "order": 4,
          "character": "Mcginnis",
          "audioFile": "forge_match_start_gigawatt_forge_convo03_04",
          "audioUrl": "audio/forge_match_start_gigawatt_forge_convo03_04.mp3",
          "text": "I'm sorry, what did you say?",
          "duration": 1.473
        },
        {
          "order": 5,
          "character": "Seven",
          "audioFile": "gigawatt_match_start_gigawatt_forge_convo03_05",
          "audioUrl": "audio/gigawatt_match_start_gigawatt_forge_convo03_05.mp3",
          "text": "You are a woman who executes pedestrian ideas at the highest level.  That makes you a master crafstman, but far from a visionary.",
          "duration": 7.561
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "conversationId": "haze_mcginnis_convo01",
      "lines": [
        {
          "order": 1,
          "character": "Mcginnis",
          "audioFile": "forge_match_start_haze_forge_convo01_01",
          "audioUrl": "audio/forge_match_start_haze_forge_convo01_01.mp3",
          "text": "After the ritual you think the OSIC's gonna pack up shop?",
          "duration": 3.267
        },
        {
          "order": 2,
          "character": "Haze",
          "audioFile": "haze_match_start_haze_forge_convo01_02",
          "audioUrl": "audio/haze_match_start_haze_forge_convo01_02.mp3",
          "text": "No, I think they'll open a permanet office.  With all the activity going on I'm shocked they haven't sooner.",
          "duration": 6.47
        },
        {
          "order": 3,
          "character": "Mcginnis",
          "audioFile": "forge_match_start_haze_forge_convo01_03",
          "audioUrl": "audio/forge_match_start_haze_forge_convo01_03.mp3",
          "text": "Planning on tansfering up here?",
          "duration": 1.44
        },
        {
          "order": 4,
          "character": "Haze",
          "audioFile": "haze_match_start_haze_forge_convo01_04",
          "audioUrl": "audio/haze_match_start_haze_forge_convo01_04.mp3",
          "text": "I'll go wherever they need me.",
          "duration": 2.459
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "conversationId": "haze_mcginnis_convo02",
      "lines": [
        {
          "order": 1,
          "character": "Haze",
          "audioFile": "haze_match_start_haze_forge_convo02_01",
          "audioUrl": "audio/haze_match_start_haze_forge_convo02_01.mp3",
          "text": "Were you working for FI when the whole Cadenza situation was going down?",
          "duration": 4.873
        },
        {
          "order": 2,
          "character": "Mcginnis",
          "audioFile": "forge_match_start_haze_forge_convo02_02",
          "audioUrl": "audio/forge_match_start_haze_forge_convo02_02.mp3",
          "text": "Yeah, that was a little intese.",
          "duration": 1.994
        },
        {
          "order": 3,
          "character": "Haze",
          "audioFile": "haze_match_start_haze_forge_convo02_03",
          "audioUrl": "audio/haze_match_start_haze_forge_convo02_03.mp3",
          "text": "I assume Fairfax wasn't thrilled.",
          "duration": 3.1
        },
        {
          "order": 4,
          "character": "Mcginnis",
          "audioFile": "forge_match_start_haze_forge_convo02_04",
          "audioUrl": "audio/forge_match_start_haze_forge_convo02_04.mp3",
          "text": "Honestly, the rest of us were more rattled than he was.  I was just a kid freaking out cause I thought I was going to lose my job, but Fairfax was surprisingly calm.  I don't think he expected Cadenza to last forever, he just wanted to make the most out of an oppurtunity before legislation caught up.  Plus the guy gets to say he created one the United States.",
          "duration": 19.783
        },
        {
          "order": 5,
          "character": "Haze",
          "audioFile": "haze_match_start_haze_forge_convo02_05",
          "audioUrl": "audio/haze_match_start_haze_forge_convo02_05.mp3",
          "text": "when you're someone who cares about legacy as much as he does, that's probably more valuable than money.",
          "duration": 6.261
        },
        {
          "order": 6,
          "character": "Mcginnis",
          "audioFile": "forge_match_start_haze_forge_convo02_06",
          "audioUrl": "audio/forge_match_start_haze_forge_convo02_06.mp3",
          "text": "Exactly",
          "duration": 0.957
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}